File name: BOSPLOOP.MP
Path description: Bountiful Oasis Loop.
Path starts: Bountiful Oasis, Shimmering Pool.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 6
Level recommendation: 40+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: handsome man, beautiful woman, rakshasha.
Additional information:

To use this loop, you need to change handsome man and beautiful woman to
'Enemy' and 'Non-hostile' under Game Data -> Monsters (this is because when
you attack the men or women, they transform into rakshashas).
